  <running_head>Admonitio.</running_head>
  <bottom_margin>
  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1">men nulla authoritas accedit ab</l>
    <l n="2">imperio Papali: sed utrique</l>
    <l n="3">objectioni puto me fecisse satis ca-</l>
    <l n="4">pitibus 18 &amp; 19.</l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Non officit mihi quod repo-</l>
    <l n="6">nit de Concilio Constantiensi</l>
    <l n="7">abrogante authoritatem Papæ,</l>
    <l n="8">nihil delibando de Religione</l>
    <l n="9">Papali, quin potius impietatis</l>
    <l n="10">colophonem addendo cæteris</l>
    <l n="11">Romanensibus doctrinis, quæ de</l>
    <l n="12">Papa non loquuntur, per decre-</l>
    <l n="13">tum quo calix Eucharisticus</l>
    <l n="14">laicis adimitur. Nam pernego</l>
    <l n="15">id Concilii, Papale imperium</l>
    <l n="16">aut evertisse aut debilitasse: ten-</l>
    <l n="17">tavisse quidem Canone Papam</l>
    <l n="18">Concilio subjicere, sed irrito</l>
    <l n="19">conatu: cum soluto Concilio</l>
    <l n="20">longè major esset Papæ author-</l>
    <l n="21">itas quam ante Concilium fue-</l>
    <l n="22">rat. Namque Patres Concilii</l>
    <l n="23">Florentini &amp; Tridentini, nihil</l>
    <l n="24">morati</l>
  </main_text>
  <notes>Running head is italic. Ornamental dots and specks on the scan are not text. Spelling as printed (e.g. "fecisse", "Papali") retained. The 's' long s has been rendered as s throughout.</notes>
